{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-50340","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78911","text":"webhost.systems — [&] Protocol Integration Spec (v1)"}]},{"id":"blk-50341","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78912","text":"Version: 1.0 Status: Draft Audience: Engineering Last updated: 2026-03-28"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50343","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78913","text":"This document extends the v1 spec to make WebHost.Systems the canonical hosting layer for [&] Protocol agents."}]}],"id":"blk-50342","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-50344","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78914","text":"0) Context"}]},{"id":"blk-50345","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78915","text":"WebHost.Systems currently treats agents as opaque code bundles deployed to Cloudflare Workers or AWS AgentCore. To serve as the hosting platform for the [&] Protocol ecosystem, WHS must understand "},{"id":"spn-78916","marks":["bold"],"text":"capability declarations"},{"id":"spn-78917","text":", "},{"id":"spn-78918","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP sidecar orchestration"},{"id":"spn-78919","text":", "},{"id":"spn-78920","marks":["bold"],"text":"agent-to-agent skill routing"},{"id":"spn-78921","text":", and "},{"id":"spn-78922","marks":["bold"],"text":"governance enforcement"},{"id":"spn-78923","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-50346","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78924","text":"This spec adds [&]-aware features as phased extensions to the existing v1 architecture. The current CRUD/deploy/invoke/telemetry foundation remains intact."}]},{"id":"blk-50347","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78925","text":"1) Capability Manifests (ampersand.json)"}]},{"id":"blk-50348","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78926","text":"1.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-50349","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78927","text":"Agents currently declare only "},{"id":"spn-78928","marks":["code"],"text":"name"},{"id":"spn-78929","text":", "},{"id":"spn-78930","marks":["code"],"text":"description"},{"id":"spn-78931","text":", "},{"id":"spn-78932","marks":["code"],"text":"framework"},{"id":"spn-78933","text":", and "},{"id":"spn-78934","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-78935","text":". There is no way for the platform to know what capabilities an agent uses ("},{"id":"spn-78936","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-78937","text":", "},{"id":"spn-78938","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-78939","text":", etc.) or what it provides."}]},{"id":"blk-50350","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78940","text":"1.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-50351","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78941","text":"Support an optional "},{"id":"spn-78942","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-78943","text":" manifest alongside the agent code bundle. When present, WHS validates it against the [&] Protocol schema and uses it for:"}]},{"id":"blk-50352","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50354","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78944","text":"Capability-aware deployment (auto-provision required MCP sidecars)"}]}],"id":"blk-50353","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50356","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78945","text":"FleetPrompt registry integration (publish agent capabilities)"}]}],"id":"blk-50355","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50358","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78946","text":"Governance enforcement (Delegatic policy checks)"}]}],"id":"blk-50357","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50359","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78947","text":"1.3 Schema"}]},{"id":"blk-50360","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78948","text":"The manifest follows "},{"id":"spn-78949","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/protocol/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json"},{"id":"spn-78950","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-50361","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78951","text":"Key fields for WHS:"}]},{"id":"blk-50362","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"agent\": \"my-agent\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"uses\": [\"&memory.graph\", \"&time.anomaly\", \"&reason.deliberate\"],\n    \"provides\": [\"&space.fleet.locate\"]\n  },\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"&memory.graph\": { \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"config\": { \"db\": \"auto\" } },\n    \"&time.anomaly\": { \"provider\": \"ticktickclock\" },\n    \"&reason.deliberate\": { \"provider\": \"auto\" }\n  },\n  \"governance\": {\n    \"autonomy\": \"advise\",\n    \"constraints\": { \"hard\": [\"no_network_without_approval\"], \"soft\": [] }\n  },\n  \"mcp_servers\": [\"graphonomous\", \"ticktickclock\"]\n}"},{"id":"blk-50363","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78952","text":"1.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-50364","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78953","text":"Add to "},{"id":"spn-78954","marks":["code"],"text":"agents"},{"id":"spn-78955","text":" table:"}]},{"id":"blk-50365","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"ampersandManifest: optional JSON blob (validated against schema on deploy)\ncapabilitiesUsed: optional string[] (denormalized from manifest for search/filter)\ncapabilitiesProvided: optional string[] (denormalized for registry)"},{"id":"blk-50366","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78956","text":"1.5 Validation"}]},{"id":"blk-50367","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78957","text":"On deployment, if "},{"id":"spn-78958","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-78959","text":" is present in the bundle:"}]},{"id":"blk-50368","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50370","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78960","text":"Validate against [&] schema (reuse "},{"id":"spn-78961","marks":["code"],"text":"@ampersand-protocol/validate"},{"id":"spn-78962","text":" npm package)"}]}],"id":"blk-50369","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78963","text":"Extract "},{"id":"spn-78964","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities.uses"},{"id":"spn-78965","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-78966","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities.provides"}]}],"id":"blk-50371","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78967","text":"Verify all declared providers are available in the deployment environment"}]}],"id":"blk-50373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78968","text":"Store validated manifest in "},{"id":"spn-78969","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.ampersandManifest"}]}],"id":"blk-50375","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-50377","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78970","text":"2) MCP Sidecar Orchestration"}]},{"id":"blk-50378","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78971","text":"2.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-50379","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78972","text":"[&] agents compose capabilities via MCP servers (Graphonomous for "},{"id":"spn-78973","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-78974","text":", TickTickClock for "},{"id":"spn-78975","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-78976","text":", etc.). Currently WHS deploys agents in isolation with no MCP server connectivity."}]},{"id":"blk-50380","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78977","text":"2.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-50381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78978","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phase 1 — Linked MCP services"},{"id":"spn-78979","text":": Allow agents to declare MCP server dependencies. WHS provisions and manages these as linked services (similar to linked databases in PaaS platforms)."}]},{"id":"blk-50382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78980","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phase 2 — MCP sidecar model"},{"id":"spn-78981","text":": For Cloudflare Workers, run MCP servers as Durable Object sidecars. For AgentCore, use linked Lambda/container sidecars."}]},{"id":"blk-50383","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78982","text":"2.3 Configuration"}]},{"id":"blk-50384","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78983","text":"In "},{"id":"spn-78984","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-78985","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-50385","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"mcp_servers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"graphonomous\",\n      \"transport\": \"streamable_http\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"db_path\": \"auto\",\n        \"embedder_backend\": \"fallback\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"},{"id":"blk-50386","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78986","text":"2.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-50387","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78987","text":"New table: "},{"id":"spn-78988","marks":["code"],"text":"linkedServices"}]},{"id":"blk-50388","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentId: Id<\"agents\">\nserviceType: \"mcp_server\" | \"database\" | \"cache\"\nserviceName: string\nproviderRef: string (provider-specific endpoint/identifier)\nconfig: JSON\nstatus: \"provisioning\" | \"active\" | \"error\" | \"deprovisioned\"\ncreatedAt: number"},{"id":"blk-50389","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78989","text":"2.5 Runtime Provider Interface Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-50390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78990","text":"Add to RPI (§20):"}]},{"id":"blk-50391","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface RuntimeProviderAdapter {\n  // ... existing methods ...\n\n  // Phase 2: MCP sidecar support\n  provisionLinkedService?(agentId: string, service: LinkedServiceConfig): Promise<ServiceRef>;\n  deprovisionLinkedService?(agentId: string, serviceRef: string): Promise<void>;\n  getLinkedServiceEndpoint?(agentId: string, serviceName: string): Promise<string>;\n}"},{"id":"blk-50392","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78991","text":"3) Agent-to-Agent Skill Routing (A2A)"}]},{"id":"blk-50393","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78992","text":"3.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-50394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78993","text":"Currently only human→agent invocation is supported. [&] agents need to invoke skills on other agents (e.g., a fleet coordinator querying a spatial intelligence agent)."}]},{"id":"blk-50395","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-78994","text":"3.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-50396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78995","text":"Add A2A invocation support using the A2A protocol (agent-to-agent, complementary to MCP):"}]},{"id":"blk-50397","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-78996","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill declaration"},{"id":"spn-78997","text":": Agents declare "},{"id":"spn-78998","marks":["code"],"text":"a2a_skills"},{"id":"spn-78999","text":" in their manifest"}]}],"id":"blk-50398","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79000","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill discovery"},{"id":"spn-79001","text":": WHS maintains an internal skill registry (derived from manifests)"}]}],"id":"blk-50400","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79002","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill invocation"},{"id":"spn-79003","text":": Agents can invoke skills on other agents via a WHS-mediated endpoint"}]}],"id":"blk-50402","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50405","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79004","marks":["bold"],"text":"Governance"},{"id":"spn-79005","text":": All A2A calls pass through Delegatic policy checks"}]}],"id":"blk-50404","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-50406","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79006","text":"3.3 API Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-50407","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"POST /api/v1/a2a/invoke\n{\n  \"caller_agent_id\": \"agent_abc\",\n  \"skill\": \"fleet-state-enrichment\",\n  \"input\": { ... },\n  \"session_id\": \"optional\"\n}"},{"id":"blk-50408","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79007","text":"WHS resolves the skill to a target agent, checks governance policies, invokes the target, and returns the result."}]},{"id":"blk-50409","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79008","text":"3.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-50410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79009","text":"New table: "},{"id":"spn-79010","marks":["code"],"text":"skillRegistry"}]},{"id":"blk-50411","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentId: Id<\"agents\">\nskill: string\ncapability: string (&space.fleet, etc.)\nstatus: \"active\" | \"inactive\""},{"id":"blk-50412","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79011","text":"4) Governance Enforcement (Delegatic Integration)"}]},{"id":"blk-50413","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79012","text":"4.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-50414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79013","text":"WHS currently enforces only tier-based billing limits. [&] agents need governance enforcement: hard/soft constraints, autonomy levels, goal-aware authorization, and audit trails."}]},{"id":"blk-50415","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79014","text":"4.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-50416","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79015","text":"Integrate with Delegatic for governance:"}]},{"id":"blk-50417","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50419","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79016","marks":["bold"],"text":"Policy attachment"},{"id":"spn-79017","text":": Link agents to Delegatic org/policy trees"}]}],"id":"blk-50418","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50421","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79018","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pre-invocation check"},{"id":"spn-79019","text":": Before invoking an agent, check Delegatic policies"}]}],"id":"blk-50420","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79020","marks":["bold"],"text":"Audit forwarding"},{"id":"spn-79021","text":": Forward invocation telemetry to Delegatic audit trail"}]}],"id":"blk-50422","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79022","marks":["bold"],"text":"Autonomy enforcement"},{"id":"spn-79023","text":": Respect "},{"id":"spn-79024","marks":["code"],"text":"observe | advise | act"},{"id":"spn-79025","text":" autonomy levels from manifests"}]}],"id":"blk-50424","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-50426","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79026","text":"4.3 Configuration"}]},{"id":"blk-50427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79027","text":"In "},{"id":"spn-79028","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-79029","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-50428","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"governance\": {\n    \"delegatic_org_id\": \"org_xyz\",\n    \"autonomy\": \"advise\",\n    \"constraints\": {\n      \"hard\": [\"no_network_without_approval\", \"no_filesystem_write\"],\n      \"soft\": [\"prefer_local_inference\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-50429","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79030","text":"4.4 Invocation Flow Change"}]},{"id":"blk-50430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79031","text":"Updated Flow C (Invoke agent):"}]},{"id":"blk-50431","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50433","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79032","text":"Client calls "},{"id":"spn-79033","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /invoke/:agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-50432","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50435","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79034","text":"Control plane authenticates/authorizes"}]}],"id":"blk-50434","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50437","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79035","marks":["bold"],"text":"NEW"},{"id":"spn-79036","text":": If agent has governance config, call Delegatic policy check"}]}],"id":"blk-50436","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50439","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79037","text":"Check plan limits and agent status"}]}],"id":"blk-50438","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79038","text":"Route to runtime provider"}]}],"id":"blk-50440","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79039","marks":["bold"],"text":"NEW"},{"id":"spn-79040","text":": Forward telemetry to Delegatic audit"}]}],"id":"blk-50442","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50445","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79041","text":"Return response"}]}],"id":"blk-50444","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-50446","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79042","text":"5) Provider Registry (Dynamic Resolution)"}]},{"id":"blk-50447","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79043","text":"5.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-50448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79044","text":"Runtime providers (Cloudflare, AgentCore) are hardcoded. [&] agents declare capability providers that should be resolved dynamically (e.g., "},{"id":"spn-79045","marks":["code"],"text":"\"provider\": \"auto\""},{"id":"spn-79046","text":" should resolve to the best available provider for "},{"id":"spn-79047","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-79048","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-50449","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79049","text":"5.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-50450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79050","text":"Add a capability provider registry to WHS:"}]},{"id":"blk-50451","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Provider: graphonomous → Capabilities: [&memory.graph, &memory.consolidate, &reason.deliberate, &reason.attend]\nProvider: ticktickclock → Capabilities: [&time.anomaly, &time.forecast, &time.pattern]\nProvider: geofleetic → Capabilities: [&space.fleet, &space.route, &space.geofence]\nProvider: bendscript → Capabilities: [&memory.graph (KAG)]"},{"id":"blk-50452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79051","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-79052","marks":["code"],"text":"\"provider\": \"auto\""},{"id":"spn-79053","text":", WHS resolves to the best available provider based on:"}]},{"id":"blk-50453","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79054","text":"Capability match"}]}],"id":"blk-50454","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79055","text":"Provider availability in deployment region"}]}],"id":"blk-50456","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79056","text":"Cost tier of the user's plan"}]}],"id":"blk-50458","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79057","text":"Governance constraints"}]}],"id":"blk-50460","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-50462","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79058","text":"6) Provenance and Audit Trail"}]},{"id":"blk-50463","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79059","text":"6.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-50464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79060","text":"Currently invocations have basic "},{"id":"spn-79061","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-79062","text":" but no hash-linked provenance chain. For [&] agents, every decision should be traceable back through the capability calls that informed it."}]},{"id":"blk-50465","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79063","text":"6.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-50466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79064","text":"Extend telemetry events with provenance fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-50467","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface TelemetryEvent {\n  // ... existing fields ...\n\n  // [&] provenance extension\n  ampersand?: {\n    capabilities_invoked: string[];      // [\"&memory.graph.recall\", \"&time.anomaly.detect\"]\n    routing_decision: \"fast\" | \"deliberate\";  // κ routing result\n    kappa_value?: number;                // cyclicity score if deliberation was triggered\n    goal_id?: string;                    // Graphonomous GoalGraph reference\n    provenance_hash?: string;            // hash-linked to parent invocation\n    a2a_calls?: {\n      